    "updated_at": "2026-11-28T00:55:11Z",
    "body": "Scope addition: PR #4463 (#4389, holder import and export) adds two more MCP tools, `export_holders` and `import_holders`. The `camcraft-mcp` skill needs rows for them too. Please add all three rows (`edit_user_holder`, `export_holders`, `import_holders`) in the same process PR, after #4463 merges.\n\n- `export_holders`: writes the user holders of the document to a `camcraft-components/1` file. It asks for file-write approval in a live session.\n- `import_holders`: reads holder rows from a `camcraft-components/1` file as one undo step. A row keeps its file id when the id is free, else it gets `user:holder:<name>` (then ` (2)`, ` (3)`). A bad file (bad JSON, truncated, wrong envelope, no row, a row that is not a holder) is refused by name and nothing is applied.\n",
